# Phase 1 CLI acceptance — end-to-end reading, edition lifecycle, RTL (AC-P1-16)

`QAI_DATA_DIR` points the real `qai` binary at a fresh temp database (set by the
harness); each `console` block below runs in order against that one database, so
`db migrate` must come first and `test-edition-min@0.1.0` is activated before any
read.

Human-readable output avoids volatile values (uuids, timestamps, migration
numbers); the `--json` block is deterministic for this synthetic edition.

```console
$ qai db migrate
migrations applied; schema version [..]

```

```console
$ qai quran import ../../fixtures/quran/test-edition-min/manifest.json
imported test-edition-min@0.1.0 to Staged

```

```console
$ qai quran activate test-edition-min@0.1.0 --yes
activated test-edition-min@0.1.0 (generation 1)

```

Reading a verse prints the Uthmani text (right-to-left script preserved) on the
first line and a provenance citation on the second.

```console
$ qai quran get 1:1
أوَيت تَساكُن كن لهُم ثُشأوَ
— quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:1:1

```

```console
$ qai quran get 1:1 --json
{
  "canonical": {
    "arabic_text": "أوَيت تَساكُن كن لهُم ثُشأوَ",
    "ayah_range": [
      1,
      1
    ],
    "deep_link": "/read/test-edition-min@0.1.0/1:1",
    "edition": {
      "riwayah": null,
      "script": "uthmani",
      "slug": "test-edition-min",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    "juz": 1,
    "page": 1,
    "reference": "quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:1:1",
    "surah_name_arabic": "سورة تجريبية 1",
    "surah_name_translit": "Test-1",
    "surah_number": 1,
    "text_hash": {
      "algorithm": "Sha256",
      "hex": "2c656d34d59038eed42464f08e753d2d6d16f702f09b8b05789abcaae792ba31"
    },
    "translation": null
  },
  "tokens": null,
  "translations": [],
  "word_glosses": null
}

```

```console
$ qai quran resolve 1:1
1:1
active edition: test-edition-min@0.1.0

```

```console
$ qai quran edition active
test-edition-min@0.1.0

```

```console
$ qai quran edition show test-edition-min@0.1.0 --statistics --hashes
test-edition-min@0.1.0 — Synthetic test edition (non-canonical, ADR-0101 fallback)
status: active
surahs=5 ayahs=14 tokens=64
text=235795cb218c2df44496265b4ba5c3377d48944cb28cc4ff64c6104770932704
structure=4aa52bfaa4839bc5eb38157e44bfeaace76c0b1bc55e754b2ed6aa0da9e7a8fb
order=033673b04dbaebd0f754711d912f742b237e34298bca70024b0982ddec1b2d1a

```

Context stays inside the focal surah (no ayah precedes `2:1` in surah 2).

```console
$ qai quran surah 1
أوَيت تَساكُن كن لهُم ثُشأوَ
شُأويَت يت اكَن بَلهمُ مثشُأو أوُ
ثش ويُت سُاكنَ

```

```console
$ qai quran surah 1 --metadata
سورة تجريبية 1
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:1:1

```

```console
$ qai quran context 2:1 --before 1 --after 1
نَبلهُم هم شأُو يُتساَ اكنَبل بلَ
كن لهَم ثَشأوُ
— quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:2:1

```

Divisions enumerate their member verses in canonical order.

```console
$ qai quran division juz 1
juz 1 (8 ayahs)
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:1:1 أوَيت تَساكُن كن لهُم ثُشأوَ
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:1:2 شُأويَت يت اكَن بَلهمُ مثشُأو أوُ
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:1:3 ثش ويُت سُاكنَ
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:2:1 نَبلهُم هم شأُو يُتساَ اكنَبل بلَ
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:2:2 كن لهَم ثَشأوُ
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:3:1 أو تسُا كُنبلَ
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:3:2 شأَو يَتساُ اكنُبل بلُ
quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:3:3 ثُشأوَ ويتَسا ساَ نَبل همثُش

```

## Translations

A translation is stored attributed (principle 5) and only rendered when
explicitly requested, so quotation and translation are never conflated.

```console
$ qai quran translation import ../../fixtures/quran/test-translation-min.json
imported translation tr-en-test-1.0.0

```

```console
$ qai quran translation list
en-test@1.0.0 — Test Translator [en]

```

```console
$ qai quran get 1:1 --translations en-test
أوَيت تَساكُن كن لهُم ثُشأوَ
— quran:test-edition-min@0.1.0:1:1
[Test Translator] test words one one

```

## Edition lifecycle

A second version is staged, validated, activated (generation 2), diffed against
the first, then rolled back (generation 3). Canonical rows are never rewritten;
activation just moves the pointer.

```console
$ qai quran import ../../fixtures/quran/test-edition-min-v2.json
imported test-edition-min@0.2.0 to Staged

```

```console
$ qai quran validate test-edition-min@0.2.0
test-edition-min@0.2.0: 0 fatal, 0 errors, 0 warnings (pass)

```

```console
$ qai quran activate test-edition-min@0.2.0 --yes
activated test-edition-min@0.2.0 (generation 2)

```

```console
$ qai quran diff test-edition-min --from 0.1.0 --to 0.2.0
test-edition-min: 0.1.0 → 0.2.0: 0 added, 0 removed, 1 changed, 13 unchanged
~ 1:1

```

```console
$ qai quran edition list
test-edition-min@0.1.0 [deprecated]
test-edition-min@0.2.0 [active]

```

```console
$ qai quran rollback test-edition-min --to 0.1.0 --yes
rolled back test-edition-min to 0.1.0 (generation 3)

```

```console
$ qai quran hashes test-edition-min@0.1.0
test-edition-min@0.1.0:
  text_hash: 235795cb218c2df44496265b4ba5c3377d48944cb28cc4ff64c6104770932704
  structure_hash: 4aa52bfaa4839bc5eb38157e44bfeaace76c0b1bc55e754b2ed6aa0da9e7a8fb
  token_order_hash: 033673b04dbaebd0f754711d912f742b237e34298bca70024b0982ddec1b2d1a

```

## Errors

Re-activating an edition that is no longer staged is a conflict (exit 6); the
message names the edition.

```console
$ qai quran activate test-edition-min@0.1.0 --yes
? 6
error: no staged edition test-edition-min@0.1.0

```

A reference outside the imported corpus is not found (exit 5).

```console
$ qai quran get 9:1
? 5
error: ayah not found: 9:1

```
